==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s (100%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat (Enemy)|Yakisoba U.F.O. Cats]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

